0–10 V driver one checkpoint at a time, following `MAGNET_COMMISSIONING.md`.
Sunday's successful endpoint is a repeatable short, low-duty pull at a known
measured current, with clean release. Do not claim force calibration today.

Current checkpoint: **Checkpoint 1 — unpowered preflight**.
- The commissioning plan and rig inventory have been reviewed.
- No driver, coil or power wiring has yet been changed in this session.
