2. Exact final reward-delay target within the locked 500–1000 ms range; acquisition ramp is locked at
   0 extra delay initially, then +50–100 ms/session after stable performance
3. Success cue LabVIEW site: Case 4 vs water-loop frame 0
4. Random-block `mag`: pre-scripted file (preferred) vs live RNG

